      {
        "id": "textbook-definition",
        "moduleId": "directive-recognition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：以点开头的汇编器指令",
        "markdown": "教材把以 `.` 开头的语句称为**汇编器指令**（directive，中文译名尚不统一）。例程中的 `.section`、`.globl` 都属于这一类。判别时先看行首：在汇编语言中，以 `.` 开头的都是汇编器指令。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "汇编语言初识",
                "汇编器指令(Directive)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 668,
              "lineEnd": 671,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0803b4c4bcf32fc4690889e5db9d2261ab6a108207e02b7376f1d161a3a1f1b3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-name-analogy",
        "moduleId": "directive-recognition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "note",
        "title": "补充：directive 指示的是谁",
        "markdown": "`directive` 本义是“指示、指令”，但它指示的对象是**汇编器**，而不是 CPU。可以把它想成给排版工人的批注：批注本身不会印到成书上，却决定了内容怎样排版。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-not-machine-code",
        "moduleId": "assembly-time-role",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "教材要点：如何做，而不是做什么",
        "markdown": "汇编器指令一般不会被直接翻译成机器码。教材强调：它不是告诉汇编器**做什么**，而是告诉汇编器**如何做**。例如 `.section __TEXT,__text` 的作用是安排汇编过程，并不产生一条可执行的机器指令。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "汇编语言初识",
                "汇编器指令(Directive)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 668,
              "lineEnd": 671,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0803b4c4bcf32fc4690889e5db9d2261ab6a108207e02b7376f1d161a3a1f1b3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-two-phases",
        "moduleId": "assembly-time-role",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：把程序的一生分成两个阶段",
        "markdown": "把程序的一生分成两个阶段，就能看清区别：\n\n- **汇编期**：汇编器读取源码，按汇编器指令安排段、符号等处理方式。\n- **运行期**：CPU 只执行由普通指令翻译出的机器码。\n\n汇编器指令在运行期已经“用完”了，CPU 既看不到它，也不会为它执行任何动作。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition",
            "textbook-not-machine-code"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-example-contrast",
        "moduleId": "example-anatomy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "example",
        "title": "教材例证：同一文件中的两种命运",
        "markdown": "回到教材的最小例程：`mov w0, #0` 会被汇编器直接翻译成机器码，最终由 CPU 执行；而 `.section __TEXT,__text` 不会被翻译成机器码，在最终可执行文件中找不到这句话。两者写在同一个源文件里，处理方式却完全不同。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-cf3aa79f1cccb75df1c64c0a",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000035"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "汇编语言初识",
                "汇编器指令(Directive)"
              ],
              "lineStart": 668,
              "lineEnd": 671,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "0803b4c4bcf32fc4690889e5db9d2261ab6a108207e02b7376f1d161a3a1f1b3"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-example-walkthrough",
        "moduleId": "example-anatomy",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "补充：逐行分类例程",
        "markdown": "按上面的标准逐个检查例程中的行：\n\n| 源程序行 | 类别 | 是否进入机器码 |\n|---|---|---|\n| `.section __TEXT,__text` | 汇编器指令 | 否 |\n| `.globl _main` | 汇编器指令 | 否 |\n| `mov w0, #0` | 指令 | 是 |\n| `ret` | 指令 | 是 |\n\n`.section` 交代后续代码放在哪里，`.globl` 同样是交给汇编器的安排；`mov` 和 `ret` 才真正变成 CPU 执行的机器码。这些行各自的具体含义，下一节会继续拆解。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-example-contrast",
            "textbook-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-misconception",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "misconception",
        "title": "补充：常见误解",
        "markdown": "常见误解：把汇编器指令当成“运行时才执行的指令”，以为 `.section` 会在程序运行时切换内存段。实际上它只在汇编期影响汇编器的处理方式；程序运行时，相应的安排早已体现在产物的段与节布局里，CPU 不会再执行这条语句。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-not-machine-code",
            "model-two-phases",
            "textbook-example-contrast"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exercise",
        "moduleId": "check-and-transfer",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "补充：分类练习",
        "markdown": "判断下面四行中哪些是汇编器指令，并说明理由：\n\n```armasm\n.section __TEXT,__text\nmov w0, #0\n.globl _main\nret\n```\n\n参考答案：第 1、3 行以 `.` 开头，是汇编器指令；第 2、4 行是会被翻译成机器码的指令。判断理由应同时包含点前缀和“是否进入机器码”两点。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition",
            "textbook-example-contrast"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-summary",
        "moduleId": "summary-and-bridge",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "summary",
        "title": "补充：小结与下一节桥接",
        "markdown": "小结：汇编器指令以 `.` 开头，交给汇编器而不是 CPU；它描述“如何汇编”，一般不会出现在机器码中。下一节将用这套区分，逐行读懂最小程序里的 `.section`、`.globl` 与指令语句。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-definition",
            "textbook-not-machine-code",
            "textbook-example-contrast"
          ]
        }
      }
